 "intro": {
  "@es": "Hoy aprenderás a dar instrucciones y hacer peticiones con cortesía. En Portugal se usa la forma verbal de tercera persona, a menudo con **o senhor / a senhora** o sin pronombre expreso.",
  "@en": "Today you will learn to give instructions and make requests with courtesy. In Portugal, the verbal form of third person is used, often with **o senhor / a senhora** or without express pronoun."
